	(text "- Test pads: nRESET, I2C_SDA, I2C_SCL, VDD_2V0, VSYS, VBAT, GND (TP701-TP707).\n  SHPHLD (TP203, power sheet) and ACC_INT2 (TP401, sensors sheet) already have pads.\n- nRESET: test pad only. The nRF54L15 has an internal pull-up on nRESET, and SWD can reset the chip,\n  so nothing on the board drives this input. ERC: the passive test pad satisfies KiCad's 'input not driven'\n  check, so the earlier nRESET error is gone without any exclusion. This is intended, not a missing driver.\n- LED_DBG (P2.04) -> R701 1k -> D701 (0402 red) -> GND, both DNP. Fit them only for bench bring-up:\n  a lit LED would cost far more than the sleep budget."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 162.56 0)
		(effects
